{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/molliecomponents"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"module","role":"collection","title":"MollieComponents","externalID":"MollieComponents","modules":[{"name":"MollieComponents"}],"roleHeading":"Framework"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Accept card payments in your iOS app with a drop-in, PCI-aware payment UI — card tokenization and 3D Secure behind a single import."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Getting-Started","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout"],"title":"Getting Started"},{"anchor":"Presenting","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout","doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardComponent"],"title":"Presenting"},{"anchor":"Results","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult","doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePayment"],"title":"Results"},{"anchor":"Appearance","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/Theming"],"title":"Appearance"},{"anchor":"Configuration","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieEndpoints"],"title":"Configuration"},{"anchor":"Handling-Errors","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/HandlingErrors"],"title":"Handling Errors"},{"anchor":"Structures","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardFieldEvent"],"title":"Structures"},{"anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardField","doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardFieldErrorKind","doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardScheme","doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckoutEvent"],"title":"Enumerations"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieComponents"},{"text":" is the merchant-facing entry point to the Mollie Components iOS SDK. You present a payment surface — modal or embedded — hand it a server-issued client access token, and receive a single typed ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult"},{"text":" describing how the flow ended. The card number and CVC the cardholder types are captured inside Mollie’s own UI and tokenized over TLS; they never cross the documented SDK boundary into your code. Your ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onResult"},{"text":" callback receives only session metadata, never raw card data.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"3D Secure is handled for you. When the issuer requires a challenge, the SDK presents the authentication WebView, drives it to a terminal state, and folds the outcome back into the same ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult"},{"text":" you already handle — there is no separate 3DS callback to wire up.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK runs inside your app’s process. UIKit provides no platform-level isolation between your code and the SDK, so the protection of typed card data is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"contractual, not platform-enforced"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Read "},{"code":"SECURITY.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" at the repository root for the full trust model — what the SDK defends against, what it cannot enforce, and the integration practices your team must follow."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Important"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To get going in a few lines, see ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/GettingStarted"},{"text":". To map every outcome the SDK can hand back to merchant-facing behavior, see ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/HandlingErrors"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/MollieCardFieldErrorKind":{"title":"MollieCardFieldErrorKind","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/molliecardfielderrorkind","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardFieldErrorKind","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Why a card-form field currently fails validation, as surfaced on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardFieldEvent\/errorKind","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MollieCardFieldErrorKind","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MollieCardFieldErrorKind","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/MolliePayment":{"url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/molliepayment","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"do